{"ID":"20240522082309-zrpdup7","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082309-zrpdup7","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082309-zrpdup7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522083644-yhxx92o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522083652-7cr5nnn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522083644-xcp4uba\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:30,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:30\u0026#125;","title":"甲狀腺機能亢進","type":"doc","updated":"20240522083952"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522083644-yhxx92o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-yhxx92o","updated":"20240522083936"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲、瘦、來診日期97/04/05"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-md2icwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-md2icwf","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"來診原因：頸部甲狀腺腫大範圍7-8公分，腫起厚度約1公分，心悸。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-yz14mtp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-yz14mtp","updated":"20240522083750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"                    "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈西醫診斷甲狀腺機能亢進，已服用西藥一個多月，如今經人介紹要服用中藥、停掉西藥〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-07v0l0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-07v0l0u","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問診：　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　　"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-xbw9tmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-xbw9tmq","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠尚可、胃口尚好、大便一日一至二次、大便先硬後軟、小便中黃、口渴欲涼、易出汗、手溫額熱、平常覺身體熱、足溫、易疲勞、經期正常、腰不酸。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-2z4oeat","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-2z4oeat","updated":"20240522083753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈病患之媽媽問服中藥多久會好，我反問：西醫說服西藥多久痊癒，答：兩年，我回答：中醫需一年九個月，心想比西醫快三個月患者應該沒話說吧？患者馬上縐起眉頭，我立刻強調要快點可服用煎劑，不過須自費，病患說：上班不方便，我覺得都是藉口，反正病人都想水煎藥苦口又自費，用健保科學中藥粉就好，不行時再服湯劑。〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-tgu1lom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-tgu1lom","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：細數"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-nqyzgy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-nqyzgy7","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌診：淡黃濕"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-ll965ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-ll965ca","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"望診：眼睛微突"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-xcp4uba","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-xcp4uba","updated":"20240522083756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"眼診：無"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈五月中旬方能到美國跟倪師的診，希望到時能學到眼診〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-nt0v2tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-nt0v2tu","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"診斷：里有濕熱、心陽虛"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-6nbz1bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-6nbz1bt","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方：消瘰丸加減3x6p.c飯後服用"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-fkkix6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-fkkix6o","updated":"20240522083800"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈忘了老師金匱使用方劑，真是記性奇差，患者走後拿書出來一查，散xxx湯或桂枝甘草湯加減〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-5t2vu2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-5t2vu2j","updated":"20240522083842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"囑其不得吃辛辣、冰冷食品及刺激性飲料、熬夜晚睡。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-bdj7wcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-bdj7wcz","updated":"20240522083939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲、瘦、二診日期97/04/12"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-g79xs2s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-g79xs2s","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"複診自述晚上睡覺做惡夢，覺心悸依然。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-juxkq81","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-juxkq81","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方此次用消瘰丸和散xxx湯加減3x9p.c"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-rz3ay43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-rz3ay43","updated":"20240522083941"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲、瘦、三診日期97/04/22"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-5xkuw6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-5xkuw6j","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三診自述口乾減少，覺身體熱稍減，大便稍硬。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-4mhtal7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-4mhtal7","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方消瘰丸和散xxx湯加減3x9p.c"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-kjkklw3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-kjkklw3","updated":"20240522083942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲、瘦、四診日期97/05/03"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-cjxlako","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-cjxlako","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四診自述心悸依然，量其心跳次數92/分。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-oe0wk1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-oe0wk1j","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方桂枝甘草湯和散xxx湯加減3x9p.c"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-e5p18va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-e5p18va","updated":"20240522083944"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲、瘦、五診日期97/05/10"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-g0ekcjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-g0ekcjm","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五診自述心悸依然，量其心跳次數93/分，觀其頸部甲狀腺腫大依舊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-5lrgsmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-5lrgsmg","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方生脈散和散xxx湯加減3x9p.c"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-q78oa0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-q78oa0u","updated":"20240522083806"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈告知5/18出國跟診可提前拿藥〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-hqgt4jw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-hqgt4jw","updated":"20240522083947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲、瘦、六診日期97/05/17"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-7yvqvf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-7yvqvf9","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六診自述近兩日鼻塞、打噴嚏、流鼻水、咽中有痰，"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-i5pb1on","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-i5pb1on","updated":"20240522083807"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈觀其頸部甲狀腺腫大稍小但病患沒有感覺〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-qao6a2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-qao6a2w","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方炙甘草湯、解表藥和散xxx湯加減，柴胡、半夏、3x9p.c"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-ualx0v6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-ualx0v6","updated":"20240522083809"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈因甲狀腺屬三焦故加柴胡、半夏〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-twk2vbh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-twk2vbh","updated":"20240522083950"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲、瘦、七診日期97/06/21"}]},{"ID":"20240522083644-hg473xt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083644-hg473xt","updated":"20240522083644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七診自述鼻塞、打噴嚏、流鼻水已沒有，咽中仍有痰。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-my1d6f5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-my1d6f5","updated":"20240522083838"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈觀其頸部甲狀腺腫大範圍剩3~3.5公分、厚度0.5公分，這次病人自覺好很多但她敘述一奇怪現象，那就是服用5/17之藥物感冒症狀沒有後，接著服用5/10剩餘藥時皮膚發癢，我趕忙檢查她眼睛肝區發覺蠻好的、腎陽也不錯，再細想一下問患者，若再服5/17之藥會癢嗎？答說：不會，那5/10同樣藥5/17之前服會癢嗎？答：當時不會，問：5/10之藥有服用完嗎？答：因為你出國不得已只好每次服、每次癢但沒長疹子，接著把5/17也服用完，但服時皮膚不癢，聽罷！恍然大悟、原來是里病出表，倪師所說的最後一步、症現太陽。〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-nl4ii8e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-nl4ii8e","updated":"20240522083652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中藥處方炙甘草湯解表藥和散xxx湯加減柴胡、半夏3x9p.c同5/17"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-pn21sjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-pn21sjp","updated":"20240522083952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"l          "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"患者溫小姐23歲瘦八診日期97/07/02"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-w43qxx5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-w43qxx5","updated":"20240522083652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠尚可、胃口尚好、大便一日一次、大便時硬時軟、 口渴欲涼、易出汗、手溫額熱、覺身體熱、足溫、經期7/2、經行下腹稍痛、心跳93/分。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-k3bh6lj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-k3bh6lj","updated":"20240522083820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌診：舌根苔白"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈請教過師父舌根為上焦〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-ncumua5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-ncumua5","updated":"20240522083836"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"〈觀其頸部甲狀腺腫大範圍4~4.5公分、厚度0.5公分，問喝冰飲嗎？答：近日太熱所以有喝 ，晚睡嗎？答：一點才睡，妳知道為何服同樣藥甲狀腺腫又回頭嗎？答：不知道？妳因為熬夜又吃冰才如此，若想快點好，必需養成良好的生活習慣和飲食，還有若再有感冒一定要給中醫看，若給西醫看則傷腸胃、肝腎，會使表病入裡，讓妳的病更加惡化〉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-lw50827","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-lw50827","updated":"20240522083652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方炙甘草湯解表藥和散xxx湯加減柴胡、半夏、石膏3x9p.c"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-3j3w2n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-3j3w2n8","updated":"20240522083824"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"處理此患者讓我有幾點體會"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-bw62li8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-bw62li8","updated":"20240522083827"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"1.原來甲狀腺機能亢進，也有的是由表病入里或表裡俱病，因為以前醫治病患皆沒有成功過，所以觀察不到此現象，還是得感謝恩師的教導，方能臻此境界。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-ujlv1eo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-ujlv1eo","updated":"20240522083825"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"2.沒法跟診的同學看到案例也可知道，只要學習到的是正確的中醫知識，就算沒跟診也能醫治以前不會之疾病。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-mrbxhms","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-mrbxhms","updated":"20240522083826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"3.科學中藥的發明我覺得不是好事，當然它很方便但是會讓醫者減少煎劑的使用率，反而不能快速解決患者的問題，而讓民眾有中藥治病慢的錯覺。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-ade5w69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-ade5w69","updated":"20240522083828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"4.中醫治病需考慮的因素很多，像此位患者沒變方而情況加重，可見患者的飲食及生活習慣，對能否治癒有決定性的影響，而中醫的寒、熱觀念又再一次顯示其重要性。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-uy6w7fb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-uy6w7fb","updated":"20240522083828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"5.此例讓我對「鹹能軟堅」這句話體會尤深，本草經所寫之語、真是至理名言。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-n0sh3jv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-n0sh3jv","updated":"20240522083652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"弟子 趙醫師 敬書"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-1mmu89z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-1mmu89z","updated":"20240522083833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 老師評語 :"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 這位趙醫師是非常謙虛待人的中醫師，進入經方的大門後，改變了過去的治病與診斷方式，讀者從這一醫案中就可以體會到，他的功力也在日日精進之中，將來必也是一方之主，他是能將經方發揚光大的中醫師，我門中真正是人才濟濟，非常棒啊。"}]},{"ID":"20240522083652-7cr5nnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522083652-7cr5nnn","updated":"20240522083652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈 謹記於台北07/04/2008"}]}]}